#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:10
msgid ""
"原15类主图及两张补充图的代码依据保持`0111c8d3b9c7b37d258b9c401070305b13b6f3a1`。 FIG-16 描述 "
"`c4249e98` 基线之后的 I/O 增量机制，其具体源码链接和执行状态见 [本轮架构说明](../../design/io-"
"evolution.md)与42项台账，不能继承原候选资格。 文档工具的实际结果另见执行记录。图源为可编辑 DOT，输出为本地 SVG；标签、 "
"线型和文字共同表达关系，不只依赖颜色。"
msgstr ""
"The original 15 main views and two supplements retain code basis "
"`0111c8d3b9c7b37d258b9c401070305b13b6f3a1`. FIG-16 describes I/O evolution "
"after baseline `c4249e98`; [the iteration design](../../design/io-"
"evolution.md) and 42-item ledger supply source links and execution status. "
"It cannot inherit the earlier candidate qualification. Actual documentation-"
"tool results remain in execution records. Editable DOT produces local SVG; "
"labels, line styles and text express relationships together rather than "
"relying on color alone."

