#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:89
msgid ""
"外部唯一执行者串行调用start/stop。start不启动调度器；失败的primary、cleanup、remaining_effects分别保留。已取得效果者参与逆序cleanup，停止可能先成功释放部分实例再返回BUSY/IO。不能把BUSY视为仍然完整运行，也不能因timeout回收存储。具体start_system失败可能在其私有路径中完成清理或保留失败阶段，重试必须满足该provider合同，不能把图视为统一恢复API。"
msgstr ""
"One external executor serializes start/stop. start does not start a "
"scheduler; failures retain primary, cleanup and remaining_effects "
"separately. Owners of acquired effects participate in reverse-order cleanup."
" Stop can release some instances successfully before returning BUSY/IO. BUSY"
" cannot imply the platform is still fully running, and timeout does not "
"permit storage reclamation. A concrete start_system failure may clean up "
"inside its private path or retain the failed phase. Retry must satisfy that "
"provider contract; the diagram is not a universal recovery API."

