#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:100
msgid ""
"REJECTED/ACCEPTED是admission结果而非request状态。ACCEPTED后保持request/buffer借用，cancel/deadline只启动终止进度。provider先排空全部必要引用，再以release发布SETTLED作为对request的最后一次访问；调用方以acquire观察。相关adapter/observer另需退出。QUARANTINED到SETTLED仅在实际恢复和排空证明成立时合法，不能通过initialize强行重置借用对象。"
msgstr ""
"REJECTED/ACCEPTED are admission results, not request states. After ACCEPTED,"
" request/buffer borrowing continues; cancel/deadline only starts termination"
" progress. The provider first drains every required reference, then release-"
"publishes SETTLED as its final request access; the caller observes with "
"acquire semantics. Related adapters/observers must exit separately. "
"QUARANTINED to SETTLED is legal only after actual recovery and proof of "
"drain. initialize cannot forcibly reset a borrowed object."

