#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:111
msgid ""
"上到下为先后，并区分Task、DMA IRQ和UART IRQ。UART DMA "
"TC不替代最后串行位的TC；SPI两个DMA完成不替代BSY=0/TXE=1。最终排空与错误观察、引用撤回都先于SETTLED。CS节点描述软件命令，未证明电气电平或物理时序。取消/错误分支仍需同样的实际排空条件；失败保持QUARANTINED借用。不把NDTR推导为可靠wire字节数，也不推广为GD32"
" reset语义。"
msgstr ""
"Top-to-bottom order distinguishes Task, DMA IRQ and UART IRQ. UART DMA TC "
"cannot replace TC for the final serial bit; completion of both SPI DMA "
"streams cannot replace BSY=0/TXE=1. Final drain, error observation and "
"reference withdrawal all precede SETTLED. CS nodes describe software "
"commands and do not prove electrical levels or physical timing. Cancel/error"
" paths require the same actual drain conditions; failure retains QUARANTINED"
" borrowing. NDTR is not a reliable wire-byte count, and this view does not "
"extend to GD32 reset semantics."

