"capabilities are not inferred from the core name. Runtime has no "
"SoC/Board/startup/linker/factory; a whole platform additionally needs exact "
"providers and resources. Current M7 cold-cache control does not extend to "
"other cache-equipped cores. Software gates in the view require actual "
"evidence within their own scope and cannot inherit historical counts. Real "
"context preservation, coherency, privilege and waveforms still need physical"
" acceptance."

