"objects; runtime edges separately label lookup, calls, copied results and "
"actual MMIO observations. The factory returns existing faces only. All "
"execution, input, vectors, stack and diagnostics during the busy interval "
"must remain in admitted RAM; the guard constrains CPU accesses only. The "
"dashed withdrawal/join precondition for other bus masters belongs to the "
"external maintenance caller. It creates no platform worker and does not "
"prove hardware has stopped."

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:234
msgid ""
"目标依据：[RAM 维护目标合同](../../design/h743-flash-ram.md)、 [既有 H743 provider "
