"execution.csv>`. {download}`Editable DOT <h743-flash-ram-architecture.dot>`."
" Rendering, independent semantic review, bilingual output checks, actual "
"browser review and software/hardware qualification for the new figures "
"require separate records; none can be inferred from the draft."

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:240
msgid "FIG-18 RAM 维护结清目标设计"
msgstr "FIG-18 Target RAM maintenance settlement design"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:242
msgid ""
"**身份：target。范围：选定 V 修订／Cache off 的同步物理脉冲；这是协议阶段， 不新增公共 request "
"enum，不证明有界返回时间。**"
msgstr ""
"**Identity: target. Scope: selected V/cache-off synchronous physical pulse; "
"these are protocol stages, not a new public request enum or a bounded "
"return-time proof.**"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:245
msgid ""
"![FIG-18 target：deadline 到期继续保留保护并真实排空；只有双 Bank 空闲、LOCK 与精确恢复证明成立才返回；永久 busy"
" 无返回边](h743-flash-ram-lifecycle.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![FIG-18 target: deadline expiry retains protection and real drain; return "
"requires both-bank idle, LOCK and exact restoration proofs; permanent busy "
"has no return edge](h743-flash-ram-lifecycle.svg)"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:245
msgid ""
"FIG-18 target：deadline 到期继续保留保护并真实排空；只有双 Bank 空闲、LOCK 与精确恢复证明成立才返回；永久 busy "
"无返回边"
msgstr ""
"FIG-18 target: deadline expiry retains protection and real drain; return "
"requires both-bank idle, LOCK and exact restoration proofs; permanent busy "
"has no return edge"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:247
msgid ""
"每条边表示有条件的控制流。触发前已有临时效果的拒绝必须先证明回退；触发后 TIMEOUT 只锁存结果，不撤销脉冲，也不返回 Flash "
"handler。双 Bank 真实空闲后， 仍须证明 LOCK、TIM2 时间域／epoch 及精确 MPU／VTOR 恢复；CPU bridge "
"的精确恢复由实际 ARM 指令流另行证明。永久 busy 持续留在 RAM 排空环；无法证明恢复则留在不返回 RAM fail-"
"stop，不暗示自动复位或喂狗。 所有返回的 RAM 路径，包括触发前 VTOR 发布拒绝和 guard／deadline 拒绝，都必须 "
"先通过共同返回门：双 Bank 空闲、guard 无保留效果、完整保存的目标控制值与 LOCK 已读回证明；必要时先锁定空闲目标，再恢复 VTOR。"
msgstr ""
"Each edge is guarded control flow. Pre-trigger rejection after temporary "
"effects must first prove rollback. After trigger TIMEOUT latches a result "
"only; it neither cancels the pulse nor returns to a Flash handler. Actual "
"both-bank idle still requires LOCK, the TIM2 domain/epoch and exact MPU/VTOR"
" restoration proofs; exact CPU-bridge restoration is proved separately "
"against actual ARM instructions. Permanent busy remains in the RAM drain "
"loop; unproved restoration remains in nonreturning RAM fail-stop, without "
"implying automatic reset or watchdog service. Every returning RAM path, "
"including pre-trigger VTOR-publication refusal and guard/deadline refusal, "
"must first pass the common return gate: both banks idle, no retained guard "
"effects and readback proof of the complete saved target-control value with "
"LOCK. Lock the idle target first if necessary, then restore VTOR."

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:255
msgid ""
"目标依据：[RAM 维护目标合同](../../design/h743-flash-ram.md)、 [Arch "
"合同](../../design/arch-contracts.md)、 "
"[当前软件与物理资格边界](../../delivery/qualification.md)。 {download}`可编辑 DOT "
"<h743-flash-ram-lifecycle.dot>`。图中返回条件仍需实际 生产 ELF、真实 provider 测试与物理 station "
"分别建立证据。"
msgstr ""
"Target basis: [RAM maintenance target contract](../../design/h743-flash-"
"ram.md), [Arch contract](../../design/arch-contracts.md), and [current "
"software and physical qualification "
"boundaries](../../delivery/qualification.md). {download}`Editable DOT "
"<h743-flash-ram-lifecycle.dot>`. The return conditions still require "
"separate actual production-ELF, real provider-test and physical-station "
"evidence."

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:261
