#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:270
msgid "FIG-21 Native RTC/LPTIM 装配、借用与重新开放"
msgstr "FIG-21 Native RTC/LPTIM assembly, loans and reopen"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:272
msgid ""
"**身份：current；虚线硬件分支为 target。范围：所选 Native 日历／有限计数实例， 普通 TOML 经现有 "
"IR／provider／factory／Platform 装配，显式生命周期与真实排空。**"
msgstr ""
"**Identity: current; the dashed hardware branch is target. Scope: selected "
"Native calendar/finite-counter instances, ordinary TOML through existing "
"IR/provider/factory/Platform, explicit lifecycle and actual withdrawal.**"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:275
msgid "![Native RTC/LPTIM 的构建期装配、运行调用、最终访问和私有重新开放](rtc-lptim-lifecycle.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![Native RTC/LPTIM build-time assembly, runtime calls, final access and "
"private reopen](rtc-lptim-lifecycle.svg)"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:275
msgid "Native RTC/LPTIM 的构建期装配、运行调用、最终访问和私有重新开放"
msgstr ""
"Native RTC/LPTIM build-time assembly, runtime calls, final access and "
"private reopen"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:277
msgid ""
"构建边、运行调用和请求源推进均有独立标签。factory 只返回已有接口面；生成的 Platform 首次准备构造一次，后续对已构造 owner "
"调用私有 start。stop 先关闭准入， 撤源失败仍保留请求和 owner；私有 start 优先拒绝保留责任。真实撤源并完成外部 join "
"后，重新开放先推进代次再开放准入，保留日历、速率、时钟与外部故障。模型推进不 发布请求结果。虚线硬件适配需要独立 "
"SoC／时钟／备份域／IRQ／STOP／VBAT 合同， 不表示已有物理驱动或 HIL 通过。"
msgstr ""
"Build edges, runtime calls and source progression have distinct labels. "
"Factory only returns existing faces; generated Platform first constructs "
"once and later calls private start on a constructed owner. Stop first closes"
" admission; failed withdrawal retains request and owner, and private start "
"gives retained responsibility priority. After actual withdrawal and external"
" joins, reopen advances generation before opening admission and preserves "
"calendar, rate, clock and external fault. Model progression does not publish"
" requests. Dashed hardware adaptation needs separate SoC/clock/backup-"
"domain/IRQ/STOP/VBAT contracts and does not establish a physical driver or "
"HIL pass."

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:284
msgid ""
"依据：[RTC/LPTIM 说明](../../explanation/rtc-lptim.md)、 [公共 "
