"SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/rtc.h)、 [公共 LPTIM](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/lptim.h)、 "
"[Native 实现](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/io/native/rtc_lptim.c)、 [Native 装配](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/configure/providers/native/bindings.py)。 {download}`可编辑 DOT "
"<rtc-lptim-lifecycle.dot>`；实施关联：IO-36。软件开发证据与 main／SDK／ "
"候选／实板资格分别判断，不能从该图或渲染成功推断。"
