"physical safety or low-power qualification.**"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:296
msgid ""
"![FIG-22：冷态 pad/gate 租约、显式目标读回、provider 撤驱动与 Platform 原快照恢复分开；失败保留责任](gpio-"
"pin-states.svg)"
msgstr ""
