"withdrawal is separate from Platform restoration of the original snapshot; "
"failure retains responsibility](gpio-pin-states.svg)"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:296
msgid "FIG-22：冷态 pad/gate 租约、显式目标读回、provider 撤驱动与 Platform 原快照恢复分开；失败保留责任"
msgstr ""
"FIG-22: cold pad/gate lease and explicit target readback; provider driver "
"withdrawal is separate from Platform restoration of the original snapshot; "
"failure retains responsibility"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/assets/diagrams/README.md:298
msgid ""
"构建箭头只表示 Board/TOML 到不可变计划与静态对象的生成；factory 箭头只返回既有 face。运行选择不转让 pad "
"所有权。失败可能保留部分寄存器效果；重试目标或检查 stop 不能丢弃 lease。provider stop 成功后，Platform "
"仍须独立证明冷快照与 gate 清理；失败继续保留。图不表达 AF、wake、retention、深睡或实板结果。"
msgstr ""
"Build arrows represent only generation from Board/TOML into immutable plans "
"and static objects; factory arrows only return the existing face. Runtime "
"selection does not transfer pad ownership. Failure can retain partial "
"register effects; target retries or checked stop must not discard the lease."
" After provider stop succeeds, the Platform must still independently prove "
"cold-snapshot restoration and gate cleanup; unfinished responsibilities "
"remain retained on failure. The figure does not express AF, wake, retention,"
" deep sleep or physical-board results."

