msgid ""
"可选 USB EP0 packetizer 沿同一显式调用路径组合包层 face：应用拥有 outer request， 调用者提供 "
"adapter 存储，组件维护两个固定 inner packet 槽；provider 保留已准入 包的临时借用。ROM profile "
"只是生成的只读选定事实。inner DATA ACK、outer STATUS ACK 与地址提交分别观察， 借用不随 epoch "
"更新或取消而撤销；OUT0 恢复需外部 controller owner 授权。 本图不展开 USB 协议阶段，精确边界见 [USB FS "
"device 合同](../../design/usb-device.md)。"
msgstr ""
"The optional USB EP0 packetizer composes packet-layer faces along the "
"same explicit call path: the application owns the outer request, the "
"caller supplies adapter storage, and the component maintains two fixed "
"inner packet slots; the provider retains a temporary borrow for each "
"admitted packet. The ROM profile contains only generated read-only "
"selected facts. Inner DATA ACK, outer STATUS ACK and address commit are "
"observed separately; epoch changes or cancellation do not revoke "
"borrows, and OUT0 recovery requires authorization by the external "
"controller owner. This diagram does not expand the USB protocol phases; "
"see the [USB FS device contract](../../design/usb-device.md) for the "
"exact boundaries."
